WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.020
Another thing that Dr. Bright is not allowed
to do at the Foundation: No using excessive

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.110
force of any kind!

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.960
The SCP Foundation isn't exactly known for
using restraint when dealing with threats,

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.870
from blowing up small towns to immersing monsters
in baths of acid.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.910
But thanks to the intervention of the Ethics
Committee over the years, the Foundation has

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:24.240
learned to handle things a bit more delicately,
when possible at least.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.900
So no one is permitted to use excessive force
unless absolutely necessary.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.100
And you know who it is never necessary for?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.210
Dr. Bright.

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:39.980
And no, Dr., Excessive Force is not the same
thing as The Force, and you know it.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:42.520
Stop calling yourself an Excessive Jedi.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:43.120
Not a thing.

